483
00:52:59,681 --> 00:53:00,882
Oye, oye.

484
00:53:00,915 --> 00:53:03,851
Shh, shh, shh, shh, 
shh, shh, shh.

485
00:53:08,355 --> 00:53:10,558
Shh, shh, shh, shh.

486
00:53:48,863 --> 00:53:51,264
